Sun Sep 13 08:47:08 UTC 2026 - Fabian Vogt <fabian@ritter-vogt.de>

- Update to 6.7.90:
  * Now part of Plasma
  * For more details see https://kde.org/announcements/plasma/6/6.7.90
- Changes since 0.10.0:
  * Update version for new release 6.7.90
  * cmake: update variables to match with Plasma release scripts
  * plasmoid: fix metadata
  * Port plasmoid and daemon to use DBus, and generally port away from Qt 5
  * backupjob: make sure to convert our backup path into a url (kde#518494)
  * Omit user-level Flatpak apps and runtimes by default
  * Better exclusions system
  * kcm: fix markup error in a message
  * Drop Qt5 CI
  * Fix warning when initializing
  * applet: display "configure" and "refresh" as standalone icons
  * Modernize applet UI
  * Use default DEFAULT_SEVERITY for logging
  * Downgrade qCInfo to qCDebug
  * Add a default excluded folder path (kde#516555)
  * Change order for updating data in data engine (kde#518361)
  * Ensure that notifications and jobs by the daemon have a nice title
  * Show warning when saving plan without files (kde#513136)
  * Update CI configuration
  * Exclude ~/Vaults by default
  * Add ellipses to two buttons that require further input to take effect
  * Remove icon from appstream xml (kde#516089)
  * Improve file item action plugin name
  * Add a fileitemaction plugin (kde#499455)
  * Make UI strings adhere to KDE HIG
  * Change rsync behavior on FAT destinations (kde#494969)
  * Port to KUiServerV2JobTracker
  * Fix linter warnings
  * Fix deprecation warnings
  * Fix executable name for kcmshell
  * Add path option to filedigger
  * Edit kup.po
  * DriveSelectionDelegate: Pass QStyle state to KCapacityBar paint
  * BackupJob: Set destUrl
  * Exclude XDG_STATE_HOME by default
  * Improve link text in KCM UI
  * Add warnings for exFAT
  * Fix minor typo (missing space)
  * Simplify descriptions of backup types
  * Rephrase yes/no questions
  * Fix some strings
  * Enable KCrash
  * Add new release to appdata
- Rename to plasma6-kup

