Thu Jan  3 01:10:55 UTC 2019 - ecsos@opensuse.org

- update to 0.7.2
  - Improve solution for restoring files from bup archive on a 
    fresh OS installation. You can now launch the file digger app 
    from the backup settings module, then select where your backups 
    are stored and start restoring.
  - Improve many translations, add hungarian and chinese(china).
